cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Production readiness checklist for AI-built apps, with measured research on 53
  public repositories
message: If you use this checklist or cite these rates, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Chin
    given-names: Nic
    website: "https://nicchin.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nicuk/ai-built-app-production-readiness-checklist"
abstract: >-
  A launch checklist for applications built with Lovable, Bolt, v0, Cursor,
  Replit or Claude Code, with each item triaged by whether it blocks a launch
  and by whether it can be checked automatically or needs human judgement.
  Accompanied by a static analysis of 53 public repositories that declare the AI
  tool they were built with, reporting rates per failure category with 95%
  confidence intervals, and reporting the measured precision and recall of the
  scanner that produced them.
keywords:
  - technical due diligence
  - code audit
  - AI-generated code
  - application security
  - Supabase
  - vibe coding
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-02"
